{"seq":1,"slug":"free-and-easy-wandering","title":"Free And Easy Wandering","docCount":2,"url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/free-and-easy-wandering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"absolute-freedom","title":"逍遥游","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/free-and-easy-wandering/absolute-freedom","wordCount":1740,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-useless-and-the-great","title":"无用之用","url":"/c/people/zhuangzi/ideas-and-methods/free-and-easy-wandering/the-useless-and-the-great","wordCount":1505,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现庄子思想的灵魂——\"逍遥游\"。它描绘了一种绝对自由、无所依待、超越一切束缚的精神境界。庄子以鲲鹏的寓言开篇，区分\"有待\"与\"无待\",指出真正的逍遥是\"无待\"的、绝对的自由，而达到这一境界的关键在于\"至人无己\"——超越执着的小我。本章还阐发了\"无用之用\"的智慧——超越世俗功利价值、保全本真。\n"}